2C3 of S/E Army, during the execution of works programmed in S/E Chiguayante (according to SD N\u00b020241166339, N\u00b0202411637, N\u00b0202416638 and N\u00b020241166440) that required that the mentioned bars 15 kV were disconnected from their respective transformers N\u00b01 and N\u00b02 66/15 kV, being energized from the cloths C3 and C4 of S/E Army, by means of enmelles MT. The cause of the disconnection is attributed to that inadvertently it was a reconnector of the MT network of the feeder Villuco (pa\u00f1o C5) of S/E Chiguayante, which prevented to materialize the necessary enmalle MT between that feeder and the above S/ C. d.3 Repetition: Renewing Physical P","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 561/2024\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de las barras N\u00b01 y N\u00b02 15 kV de S/E Chiguayante\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 20/12/2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 01/12/2024\nHora 01:24\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 13.40\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 8695.67\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.154 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Chiguayante / SE035T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV y 15 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-k\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 P14, Las Condes.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Reconectador de la red MT del alimentador Villuco /\nPA009T0058SE035T0058 (*)\nPropietario elemento fallado Compa\u00f1\u00eda General de Electricidad S.A.\nRUT 76.411.321-7\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar (**)\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 P14, Las Condes.\n(*): Corresponde al c\u00f3digo d